# WORLD-LIFETIMES (AUDIT-WORLDS A): UI data, messages, overlays and travel belong to one world - two documents, A plays.
# UI points are window points: the viewport image starts at (324,145) in this layout; button centres are (210,275),
# (210,345) and (210,415) from it (the canvases are Stretch: one unit is one pixel).
# Frames 7_preview_same and 8_game are the preview and GAMEPLAY-PROOF frames against the base, not steps of this file.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WL_UiA.desce
Дано run Scene "Open Scene WL_UiB.desce"
Дано run Scene "Open Scene WL_UiA.desce"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 1_play_a the bound text reads A, the message line reads no message
Когда input move - 534,420
Когда input click - left
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид 3_msg the message text of A shows the button's message: hello from A
Когда input move - 534,490
Когда input click - left
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид 4_toast the toast "toast of A" is over A's view, bottom right, once
Когда run Scene "Open Scene WL_UiB.desce"
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид 2_doc_b document B reads placeholder of B and no message (not A, not hello from A); no toast
Когда run Scene "Open Scene WL_UiA.desce"
Когда advance 0.5
Когда input move - 534,560
Когда input click - left
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 5_travel document A now plays level B: placeholder of B and no message, not the letter A
Когда run Action "Stop"
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид 6_stop the authored WL_UiA is back: World A, placeholder of A, its three buttons
